{"id":"f47e52113c1c33ee","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dnfdual.md","title":"CNF of the dual of a DNF","display":"thm-dnfdual — CNF of the dual of a DNF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dnfdual","aliases":["27-thm-dnfdual"],"display":"thm-dnfdual — CNF of the dual of a DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-dual]]","[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-clause]]","[[27-df-litset]]"],"local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dnfdual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dnfdual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dnfdual — CNF of the dual of a DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_L\">\\(C_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(\\{C_{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)}\\mid T\\in D\\}\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\{C_{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)}\\mid T\\in D\\})=\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(\\{C_{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)}\\mid T\\in D\\}\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\{C_{\\mathrm{Lits}(T)}\\mid T\\in D\\})=\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.1.2, Theorem 4.5，印刷页 169，PDF 第 193 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对陈述及逐点 De Morgan 证明。Literal self-dual 保持文字集不变；空 DNF 对应空 CNF，空项对应空子句，边界一致。明确区分 EvalDNF 与 EvalCNF，避免空集合的两种求值冲突。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_L$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$、$C_L$、$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dual]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_L$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$、$C_L$、$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 分